 "remarks": "Be the first to rent this completely gutted and renovated 3 bedroom house in the Spring Hill neighborhood of Norwalk. Features include hardwood floors, a basement for extra living space, and a detached garage for parking and storage. The driveway, basement and a few remaining construction details are still in progress and will be completed prior to occupancy. Set on a quiet street with easy access to major highways, just a 10 minute drive to the train station and about 65 minutes by train to NYC, making it a great option for commuters. Enjoy Norwalk beaches, parks and recreation, SoNo restaurants, and the SoNo Mall nearby.",
